1698509124551625", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1698509127884958_3462372611220339303_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F4n8QugY9HMQ7kNvwH9etN7&_nc_oc=AdpGYN3Oou5bknCDqGE92O-eFNEaS0vTIosh4TPYM8zYVsRE9ACEzITJA-x-Rm1O0Pk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMV51TKlqif07q3F66GsCF2Mga0G6HEP94C7PVqAmBwhw&oe=6ADCCEAC"}, {"file_name": "86d4207caecc4bbba54c2c06e00924ae.png", "id": "1350772766999423", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1350772770332756_3815968784629696392_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=03clarCf-GcQ7kNvwHb8Vrk&_nc_oc=Adr7d8w70rxsm9uX-mw2MQhgJE5eMHdV47O3V_6RznnR7tfKxHZiBe-gYpvYcCCMH4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNwSJ6_nX5wwTFQ2p8VRTZ4YkZ0K9BViJu0SKqsQzrrAQ&oe=6ADCB6AF"}, {"file_name": "b4d1876b8461495ba3309ffd05162fd9.png", "id": "1338667031556771", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_1338667034890104_7059448834119857994_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u1MHuW5Gwu8Q7kNvwHuC3de&_nc_oc=Ado9ozMGpTnz5l2yaZB9jd4D44vZzrDSqnStcw8K_FIpR4KsrTNDjYYDQUj5yWGdIhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMRa_Ij1CTmbS-BjPEvNdC-pZR4gJdvm1oOPSioPkXeOA&oe=6ADCD440"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SGVRTrailerCover.png", "id": "1489970458990826", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_1489970465657492_5101885299613120494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HVxjFKyb5rAQ7kNvwFYJZ8X&_nc_oc=AdpJjrFSkg441iA1V9bzq87rDW3919N2TT-y4DEmnxIXZatJBg0EluB0WlV78JURyww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNM1ll2K4ALhwZfnXXI3GW1R7K7V_7Ir_lTNQzOH_d3Ow&oe=6ADCCF5D"}, "display_name": "Singularity VR", "keywords": ["SGVR", "SingularityVR", "ClimberspaceStudios", "singularity"], "long_description": "\nExplore the Singularity.\n\nDeveloped by Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios, Singularity VR is a virtual reality experience designed to push the boundaries of immersive gaming. Whether you are stepping into a virtual world for the first time or you are a seasoned VR veteran, this game delivers a gripping, unforgettable experience built from the ground up for modern VR hardware.\n\nWe wanted to create something that feels as incredible to play as it looks. Through a passionate collaboration between our two studios, we have crafted a world that responds to your every move, drawing you deeper into the gameplay with every session.\n\nKey Features:\n\nBuilt for Immersion: Experience fluid controls, stunning visuals, and a world designed entirely around the unique strengths of virtual reality.\n\nA True Collaboration: Brought to life by the combined creative vision and technical expertise of Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios.\n\nEngaging Gameplay: Engage in competitive movement-based combat, or if you prefer a more relaxed pace, enjoy the atmosphere of Sector 1. Explore the vastness of space to experience true", "short_description": "Step into the Singularity, a collaborative VR experience built for immersion and exploration. Master unique movement mechanics, engage in competitive combat, or drift through the silence of space in stunning Zero-Gravity. Whether you are battling for victory or chilling in Sector 1, your journey into the Singularity awaits. Discover the next step in VR gaming today!"}]}, "developer_name": "Yoda's Gaming Galaxy", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/singularityvr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/tos", "publisher_name": "Climberspace Studios", "support_website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/support", "website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035